# Colorlib

> WordPress themes, HTML website templates, and web design resources trusted by millions of creators worldwide.

Colorlib is a web design resource company founded in 2013, operated by Divilab LLC. We publish free WordPress themes, 1,000+ HTML/Bootstrap website templates, and educational content about web design and development. Founded 2013; 10,000,000+ total template downloads; 50+ free WordPress themes; 1,000+ HTML templates; 100+ website example galleries.

## Main sections

- [Colorlib homepage](https://colorlib.com/): Free WordPress themes and premium HTML template downloads.
- [HTML & CSS website templates](https://colorlib.com/wp/templates/): Main hub for 1,000+ free Bootstrap and HTML templates.
- [Free WordPress themes](https://colorlib.com/wp/themes/): Colorlib's own responsive WordPress themes, all free to download.
- [Colorlib blog](https://colorlib.com/wp/): Tutorials, reviews, curated galleries, and design inspiration.
- [Theme and template support](https://colorlib.com/wp/support/): Documentation and support for Colorlib WordPress themes.

